codex
I found shipping overlap at two layers: serving stacks parse/return multiple tool calls, while LLMCompiler/ReWOO-style agent systems actually plan or expose parallel tool execution. I’m doing one last check for the claimed residual: an explicit correctness bound as a function of dependency detector false negatives.
